                  <EntityStateAttribute.FRIENDLY_NAME: 'friendly_name'>: 'Hot Water 2050 Operating status bits',
                  'guidance': "Decoded on a Trianco S300: bit 0 while the unit is switched off, bit 5 always, bit 8 while the compressor runs, bit 9 while the electric heater is on, bit 10 only during defrost (probably the 4-way valve), bits 11 and 12 while the fan runs (both clear during defrost, when the manual says the fan stops). Bit 2 cleared when the coil (T04) fell to about -3 °C (D01) and set again after a defrost or a stop; its meaning isn't confirmed. On an Indol PV300 with the same product ID (github.com/victor987/hitemp), bits 8 and 9 behaved the same.",
